Package: lunduke-linux-kernel
Version: 7.2.6-lcos12
Section: metapackages
Priority: optional
Architecture: all
Installed-Size: 28
Maintainer: LCOS <lcos@lunduke.com>
Homepage: https://lunduke.com
Depends: linux-image-7.2.6-lunduke (= 7.2.6-lcos12)
Recommends: linux-headers-7.2.6-lunduke (= 7.2.6-lcos12)
Description: Lunduke's Linux Kernel for LCOS
 Lunduke's Linux Kernel — LCOS kernel package (ABI lcos12).
 .
 Installs linux-image-7.2.6-lunduke. Headers are recommended for
 building out-of-tree modules.
 .
 lcos12 adds container basics on lcos11: user namespaces, veth,
 bridge and bridge netfilter, bpf() syscall, cgroup BPF, BPF JIT,
 memory controller, CFS bandwidth, and block I/O throttling.
 MACVLAN, IPVLAN, VXLAN, dummy, and 802.1Q VLAN stay off.
 Rust left off (No Forced Rust).
 .
 Default kernel on LCOS 0.8 ISOs (Devuan 6.x kernel removed from those
 images). On earlier LCOS releases that still ship a Distro kernel,
 installing this metapackage adds a GRUB entry alongside it.
